tools.example:
model.component("comp1").physics("solid").create("pc1", "PeriodicCondition", 2);
model.component("comp1").physics("solid").feature("pc1").selection().set(new int[]{1, 4});
model.component("comp1").physics("solid").feature("pc1").set("PeriodicType", "Floquet");
model.component("comp1").physics("solid").feature("pc1").set("kFloquet", new String[]{"kx", "ky", "0"});
// Eigenfrequency study with a parametric sweep of kx along the Brillouin zone edge

model.component("comp1").physics("solid").create("lafm1", "LinearlyAcceleratedFrame", 3);
model.component("comp1").physics("solid").feature("lafm1").selection().all();
// Frame acceleration: (0, 0, 20[m/s^2]) during a launch transient

model.component("comp1").physics("solid").create("ire1", "InertiaRelief", 3);
model.component("comp1").physics("solid").feature("ire1").selection().all();
// GUI: Create Load Groups and Study -> Stationary study with inertia relief load cases
// Application Library: Structural_Mechanics_Module/Tutorials/bracket_inertia_relief

Solid Mechanics > Linear Elastic Material 1 > Hygroscopic Swelling 1
Concentration: Concentration (tds), Concentration type: Molar, c_ref = 0[mol/m^3]
// Application Library: Structural_Mechanics_Module/Hygroscopic_Swelling/pressure_sensor_hygroscopic_swelling

model.component("comp1").physics("solid").feature("bndl1").set("harmonicPerturbation", "1");
model.component("comp1").physics("solid").feature("bndl1").create("ph1", "Phase", 2);
// Study: Frequency Domain, Prestressed (Stationary + Frequency-Domain Perturbation)
// Application Library: Structural_Mechanics_Module/Tutorials/nonlinear_harmonic

model.component("comp1").physics("solid").create("pm1", "PointMass", 0);
model.component("comp1").physics("solid").feature("pm1").selection().set(new int[]{12});
// Point mass m = 0.2[kg]; Study: Eigenfrequency

model.component("comp1").physics("solid").create("adm1", "AddedMass2", 2);
model.component("comp1").physics("solid").feature("adm1").selection().set(new int[]{4});
model.component("comp1").physics("solid").feature("adm1").set("MassType", "mPerArea");
// Application Library: MEMS piezo_mems_speaker (electrode masses), Structural_Mechanics_Module/Fluid-Structure_Interaction/fuel_tank_vibration (shell)

model.component("comp1").physics("solid").feature("spf1").create("prd1", "PreDeformation", 2);
// u0 = (0, 0, -2[mm]) to preload a seat spring
// Application Library: Structural_Mechanics_Module/Fluid-Structure_Interaction/ball_check_valve

Shell > Fasteners 1 > Hole Selection 1: select the two plates; holes detected automatically
Results > Fasteners Normal Forces / Fasteners Shear Forces evaluation groups (evaluate before plotting)
// Application Library: Structural_Mechanics_Module/Beams_and_Shells/fuselage_buckling

model.component("comp1").physics("solid").feature("crack1").create("vce1", "VirtualCrackExtension", 1);
// Sensitivity radius R_s = 0.5*crackSize, Add parametric sweep: Yes, Xa = range(0.5, da, 0.7)
// Application Library: Structural_Mechanics_Module/Fracture_Mechanics/single_edge_crack

model.component("comp1").physics("solid").create("secf1", "SectionForces", -1);
model.component("comp1").physics("solid").feature("secf1").set("sys", "sys1");
// then Update Solution and evaluate Results > Section Forces
// Application Library: Structural_Mechanics_Module/Contact_and_Friction/tube_connection
